      "bookmarkId": "29817577_10_997-1031",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "997-1031",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你并非对所有的事件都要负责，但你总是要对自己对事件的判断和反应负责。",
      "totalCount": 2128
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
