      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_4843-4882",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "4843-4882",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你的思维方式铸就了你今天的样子。这样的思维方式却并不能让你变成你想成为的样子。",
      "totalCount": 1818
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 208814311,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_13_9489-9504",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "9489-9504",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你关于金钱最强烈的信仰是什么？",
      "totalCount": 1656
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 1951703,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_8218-8279",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "8218-8279",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你想要成为什么样的人？ 你想要做什么？你想要拥有什么？",
      "totalCount": 1424
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 372740591,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_2641-2659",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2641-2659",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "所有的傻瓜都生活在希望和等待之中。”",
      "totalCount": 1265
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 202011501,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_8385-8412",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "8385-8412",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你具备能协助你获得自己想要的东西的知识、能力和计划吗？",
      "totalCount": 1224
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 260521002,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_3712-3744",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "3712-3744",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "自信指的是，一个人在自身经历的基础之上，知道他遇事可以依靠自己。",
      "totalCount": 1139
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 208814311,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_10026-10056",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "10026-10056",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "成功意味着得到你想要的东西，而幸福意味着热爱你所拥有的一切。",
      "totalCount": 1003
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 295758021,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_10_8772-8813",
      "chapterUid": 10,
      "range": "8772-8813",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "逃避问题不会使人生活富裕。想要拥有更多金钱的人，就应该为自己列一个长长的问题清单。",
      "totalCount": 969
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 35317354,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_5477-5516",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "5477-5516",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "我将生活简化为5个领域：健康、财务、关系、情感和人生意义。5个领域都同等重要。",
      "totalCount": 957
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 1951703,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_8051-8112",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "8051-8112",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "对你来说真正重要的东西是什么？ 为什么这些东西很重要？",
      "totalCount": 902
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 428541783,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_5_1491-1535",
      "chapterUid": 5,
      "range": "1491-1535",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "一旦金钱开始流动，它就会快速且大量地流入你的口袋，以至于你很惊讶以前你的钱都藏哪儿去了。",
      "totalCount": 885
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 219869970,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_11_13909-14030",
      "chapterUid": 11,
      "range": "13909-14030",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "好运的组成部分： ●储存资本； ●识别机会； ●果断地做出决定并采取行动。",
      "totalCount": 884
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 212102284,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_6316-6428",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "6316-6428",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "解决方法是：将你的事业建立在你最大的爱好之上。用你的爱好来赚钱。花点时间分析一下，你真正感兴趣的是什么、你的才能在哪方面，之后你才有可能从事一份自己既感兴趣又能赚钱的工作。",
      "totalCount": 793
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 39731253,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_2552-2573",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "2552-2573",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "希望是一种智能镇定剂，一种绝妙的自我欺骗。",
      "totalCount": 765
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 338731913,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_9_3938-3962",
      "chapterUid": 9,
      "range": "3938-3962",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "你的财务状况应该成为一个你不惧怕任何阻碍的证明。",
      "totalCount": 756
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 432542096,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_13_11370-11392",
      "chapterUid": 13,
      "range": "11370-11392",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "永远不要接受一个不会设身处地的人给出的建议。",
      "totalCount": 748
    },
    {
      "bookId": "29817577",
      "userVid": 340967619,
      "bookmarkId": "29817577_16_4693-4737",
      "chapterUid": 16,
      "range": "4693-4737",
      "simplifiedRange": "",
      "traditionalRange": "",
      "markText": "请勇于承担责任，使自己成为不可或缺的一员；请勇于放弃和下放权力，使自己成为非必要的一员。",
      "totalCount": 714
    },
